B.aS8=new A.ur("Burada \u0131\u015f\u0131k az","Perdeyi a\xe7\u0131p ya da lambay\u0131 yak\u0131p tekrar dener misin? Ayd\u0131nl\u0131k karelerde renk analizi ger\xe7e\u011fine yak\u0131n \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor.")
